      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.41 (vs ₹0.96 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.41 (up from ₹0.96 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹293.8m (up 41% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹17.5m (up 50% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 6.0% (up from 5.6% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 29% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 24% per year.",
